# Legacy a2c corpus: 18_c_interop/001_cstr

## Case: legacy-18-c-interop-001-cstr
id: "legacy.18_c_interop.001_cstr"
entry-mode: "program"

### Auto
path: "cstr.at"
```auto
use.c <stdio.h>

fn.c printf(fmt cstr, arg cstr)

fn println(msg cstr) {
    printf(c"%s\n", msg)
}

fn main() {
    let s = c"Hello!"
    println(s)
}
```

### Rust
check-id: "a2c-emit"

#### cstr.expected.c
```c
#include "cstr.h"

void println(char* msg) {
    printf("%s\n", msg);
}

int main(void) {
    char* s = "Hello!";
    println(s);
    return 0;
}
```

